drop (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * drop.js: iOS Safari ignored the scripted save after an encrypted download
    (no user gesture left after fetch + decrypt), so the file was never saved
    while the page said it was. After decrypting, show a Save button (a fresh
    tap) and, where available, the share sheet (Save to Files/Photos); the
    automatic save stays for desktop browsers.
  * share panel: encrypted files show their real names from the local keys.

